{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "4384710f5f6c7e2e4f0a9f7bfc394fa297d9c19d3a04607b12dc35fbbfe2aee8", "ja": "……？\nふたりとも、遊園地キライなの？", "zh": "……？\n你们两个，不喜欢游乐园吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "09fc5dcef01fdffb6a23a75dc4503b8c33aa4645af08f4d6f962e4ca3205b883", "ja": "ううん、好きだよ！　なんか夢みたいっていうか、\nどこに行ってもワクワクするし、乗り物も楽しいし。", "zh": "不是，喜欢呀！该怎么说呢，感觉就像在做梦一样，不管去哪儿都让人兴奋，游乐设施也很有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fe009461e8a761c1d3339ccc4d78a1449e16339c3aa7f8a60f5be081487a5ad6", "ja": "私も、嫌いっていうわけじゃないんだけど。\n楽しいのと同じくらい、不安なことがあって……。", "zh": "我也不是说讨厌，只是除了开心以外，也有同样多的不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1003_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ae0843c354d7a7907455d1b96ad1876c7fef9cc23bb9913056b757d100d5d045", "ja": "お疲れさま。\nお、みんなもう揃ってたな。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n哦，大家已经到齐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "7d36d16c8cd484a598f6ff4caf75da85759aed8f2bc068dd7fb9d447b69868cb", "ja": "おつかれさまです！\nわたしと茜ちゃんが最後みたい。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n好像只剩我和小茜最后才到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "ae2ca85a09582a74f21025b930321dd673d968f056291e5832e6574e9d2b5821", "ja": "育ちゃん。大物というのはね、\n必ず遅れてやってくるものなんだよ……！", "zh": "育。所谓大人物啊，\n总是要姗姗来迟的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "534be6838c17ef77b1f1076b07df9fba213e50b023e571551c34d746c80ba512", "ja": "茜、育に変な事を教えなくていいから。\nそれじゃみんな、資料を読みながら聞いてくれ。", "zh": "茜，别教育教奇怪的东西给育。\n好了，大家边看资料边听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "138825a79b61f5c09d920e93d77e3fa6412bbdf7ac96f77aeeb5662ad9b8cd9f", "ja": "今度の遊園地ロケは、リニューアルした施設の、\n新しい乗り物やキャラクターの紹介の仕事だ。", "zh": "这次的游乐园外景工作，是介绍翻新设施里的新游乐设施和吉祥物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7032943efbf4e8a84c4addcbab205b98267054ef99745ab9d75926a4f4a03d12", "ja": "他にもポスター撮りがあって……。", "zh": "另外还有拍摄海报的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "acaa31ab27f5ee0d15f284a3e0dba2b930df78b357c0b7d943607200e058bdc9", "ja": "ロケについては以上だ。それと、今回の番組の放送に\nあわせて、この5人で定期公演をやろうと思っている。", "zh": "外景拍摄就这些了。另外，我打算配合这次节目的播出，由这5人举办定期公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4c21ed8a88adccfe5235e1ae68dbde11af27c07b139c20002a449e5dc6c7800f", "ja": "詳細が決まったら、またその時連絡するよ。とにかく、\nロケではしゃぎすぎて、怪我しないように！", "zh": "等细节定下来再通知你们。总之，外景拍摄时别玩得太疯，注意别受伤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "290feee14b9abf39314805ee0a6bf5f801170b44d7a600794b8ecf5ea4f1a2db", "ja": "はーいっ♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "5771d0deab199b43f97fe1997a3147dfa43b0573eb2f6ed14572603fc44be7ee", "ja": "はいなのー。", "zh": "好哒～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7eb051517f18aa3c85f531768aa3fe31e8c2a9735b34200f84ac21c5ef1e8787", "ja": "……。\nハァ～……。", "zh": "……。\n唉～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d8b924ad08b833a9f7444357e9086f35a3042f8826c95afc63cae5481a58267f", "ja": "（あれ？　雪歩、なんだか元気がないな）", "zh": "（咦？雪步好像没什么精神啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ed454061987dcc722af2427877fb85d515079a6c1fc731ec10a61553a75be4b1", "ja": "（もしかして……この前、オーディションに\n落ちた事、まだ気にしているのかな）", "zh": "（难道……她还在介意之前试镜落选的事吗）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9a30cbe94fb7213412278ec37e9bcadb0c251403f041382e70c8962f50350254", "ja": "あっ……雪歩！\n少し話があるんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "啊……雪步！\n我有点事想和你聊聊，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "27ef5ba639c83fd5715c169a88075adfe1242a55b5cee4870ea110090b53afd4", "ja": "は、はい……？", "zh": "在、在……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7ec4516d4c3f32f60ec6a6938fd8b788fc8e86d0aa3f2da2fe48f18c9ab3d2bf", "ja": "この前のオーディションの事だけど……。\nその、残念だったな。", "zh": "关于上次试镜的事……那个，真是遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cbf9bb47015ed52f978cede858f70bb3c4308023664eaee907819c3bc2092294", "ja": "いえ……。\n私のほうこそ、合格できなくてすみませんでした。", "zh": "不会……\n我才应该向您道歉，没能通过选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b44bc90ab3e618202c348c1c0cf31d1265c0d0378aa8d8518b9d51bac86f3e7f", "ja": "2時間ドラマのヒロイン……。\n受かってたら、すごく大きなお仕事だったのに。", "zh": "2小时电视剧的女主角……\n要是通过了，本来会是一份非常重大的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1026_p", "source_sha256": "094129885f062d011bfd948a143b97245be04dc35036793ba8cbcf6b8233825f", "ja": "いや、雪歩はよく頑張ったよ。\nまさか当日追加の課題が、男性相手とはな……。", "zh": "不，雪步已经很努力了。\n真没想到当天临时追加的考核内容，居然是和男性对戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ad4e9e219f2d2dc2f60e03b2440199b021618ffd4c00a79a8bfe4363b1705258", "ja": "はい……台本に、『相手と腕を組む』ってあったのを\n見た瞬間、頭が真っ白になっちゃって……。", "zh": "是的……看到剧本上写着“要和对方挽着胳膊”时，脑子一下子就变得一片空白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f5d75902e5a41da05c4fc7b844a223c30287c43a3146a88dbd6cb5339a9e0369", "ja": "{$P$}が、せっかくくれた\nチャンスだったのに……。", "zh": "明明是{$P$}好不容易给我的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fd6983d38bc9b9328e7663f16d86e1e01f68bffd84bb40aa022beb2aa8fbc46d", "ja": "私じゃなかったら、きっと受かってました……うう。", "zh": "要是换个人来，肯定就通过了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a6dab1616aacce7bb57e35e38f3f824c7b4cf84e4631088606d96d4e893aafd1", "ja": "いや、雪歩のせいじゃない。当日の課題が\nわかってたら、事前に対処できた事だし……。", "zh": "不是的，这不是雪步的错。要是提前知道当天的课题，\n原本也是能在事前应对的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5aab9244a838d4cfbba81d37dbc56186ea2e0484c5a5a44a17f03485568ac10b", "ja": "今回は、縁がなかっただけだと思う。\n次はきっと大丈夫だから、また頑張ろうな！", "zh": "我觉得这次只是没这个缘分而已。\n下次一定没问题的，我们再一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1032_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cae4207248048ddbc31c1dd8b7f6d2d1c61efc033d58ade251ca0067e114d956", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそ、そうですね。次こそ……！", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n对、对啊。下次一定……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c4bc08638c8ad3b2f940d4ee0d9a19c807194b0faed12fd98727f7f0be01d8f0", "ja": "ああ。それで、ここからが本題なんだけど……\n今度の定期公演で、新曲を披露してみないか？", "zh": "啊。接下来才是正题……\n要不要在下次的定期公演上，试着演唱新歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8a0983946fee9646b82a5f493a79fed2f6e3a52fd4b5d663f0f0d39e94cb9d5b", "ja": "新曲……！\nは、はい！　私でいいなら、お願いします！", "zh": "新歌……！\n好、好的！如果是我的话，我愿意！拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2defd9ae28c6854931d4a7df2b14296f3d433ea533283dae5f2453984cfa7558", "ja": "あっ……でも、どんな曲なんですか？", "zh": "啊……不过，是什么样的歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1036_p", "source_sha256": "4fcc551ab468785fe1ccd73ae8b4b4fa06844576559abb2f7f17a36449b55248", "ja": "そこで、提案なんだけど……今までとは、\n少し違うジャンルの曲に挑戦してみてほしいんだ。", "zh": "所以，我有个提议……这次想让你挑战一下和以往稍有不同类型的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7d7fbed3cbd77875cca14861c57c937d77795bcd65615b204c74ef9abe6c5481", "ja": "えっ？　違うジャンルの曲……？", "zh": "咦？不同类型的歌曲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1038_p", "source_sha256": "8a73fd6c78b10794a11a896bc8a410c34294f52aba93344a62bd6428b613f7a8", "ja": "まずは、雪歩の意見を聞いておきたくて……\n資料を送るから、聞いてみてくれないか？", "zh": "我想先听听雪步的意见……\n我会把资料发给你，你能先听听看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1039_p", "source_sha256": "1cf6695d5cfa32b5fe3412131b59a33f925cc17dec0fb5a0f0aab6b2d38056e3", "ja": "その上で、考えてみてほしい。", "zh": "在此基础上，希望你能考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1040_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a430bff44d18b3a53bbb2f459b00a6b231b15c3661e1dcbbae87199e49cacf63", "ja": "わ、わかりました……。\n帰ったら聞いてみますね。", "zh": "我、我知道了……。\n回去之后我会试着问问看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1041_null", "source_sha256": "d61035b0ea5660e1afaeaf05982ae34c23f6ea3a694e6b7c4d54f180c13cc95c", "ja": "夜……", "zh": "夜晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1042_004yuk", "source_sha256": "384e4f897d8cdf1f5ea934e30703f10bd94c6b3889e8f2afb5f240673cc1299c", "ja": "ふぅ……。{$P$}は、\n気にするなって言ってくれたけど……。", "zh": "唉……{$P$}虽然对我说别放在心上，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "760a3d0169ebadf2623fbb048446a8472230403e7405cdca266559171724259f", "ja": "私じゃなかったら、きっと受かってたよね……。\n劇場のみんなだって、きっと……。", "zh": "要是换了别人，肯定就通过了吧……。\n剧场里的大家，也肯定……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1044_004yuk", "source_sha256": "315adf510eda34b02bb004347849285336e6183bece6e4b9c2a908789c65e9fa", "ja": "うぅ……よ、弱気になったらダメ！\n頑張るって、決めたんだから……。", "zh": "呜呜……不、不能退缩！\n我已经决定，一定要加油了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1046_004yuk", "source_sha256": "43ba4759d6f1d39a8ffae24a4b42cf4bdbf682629d098b0e2247917c08511381", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}からメール……\nそうだ。送ってもらった新曲、聞いてみようかな。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}发来的邮件……\n对了。要不要听听他发来的新歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1047_004yuk", "source_sha256": "254f0f9eec4051edb6927e933bb6a5699ae8852dbf50ece480ec624188c5a938", "ja": "じっとしてると、どんどん悪い方に考えちゃうし……。\nえっと、もらったデータを再生してっと。", "zh": "一直这么待着的话，就会不由自主地越想越糟……  \n那个，先播放一下收到的数据。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7a839a935e1ff3dd1eda5e80d66fde2312f829d4cd0350a9ac4792ae3faf4da7", "ja": "ひゃぁっ！？\nお、音量下げなきゃ……！　え、えっと、えっと。", "zh": "呀！？ \n\n得、得把音量调小……！呃、呃呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1050_yukihof", "source_sha256": "68d54aa84d9f249167a9f909d6c08b795db1abe2e37ad193d2545a7326589f63", "ja": "「雪歩～！　なんだ、今の音は！？\n大丈夫か！？」", "zh": "“雪步——！刚才那是什么声音！？\n没事吧！？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1051_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e2519242342cb50f052b73856e25981865b824d81df9d9dcb6bc9336ea456b5b", "ja": "あっ……だ、大丈夫！　なんでもないからっ！！", "zh": "啊……没、没事！什么都没有啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1052_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ccb4c0ab7a1918b68ff22a908f63b39fddd3ebb3ac441b1a21cb02bfeb63bf06", "ja": "び、びっくりしたぁ……音が大きすぎて、\nお父さんたちがいる部屋にまで届いちゃったみたい。", "zh": "吓、吓我一跳……声音太大了，好像连爸爸他们所在的房间都听到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_103_1053_004yuk", "source_sha256": "10634662a23f038c2370bb0425dc63504f962321444d495d562365abf47638f8", "ja": "けど……この激しい曲が、私の新曲？\nほ、本当に……？", "zh": "可是……这首激烈的曲子，就是我的新歌？\n真、真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
